<title>USA: N.J. Transportation Trust $712 mln sale for Oct 23.</title>
<headline>N.J. Transportation Trust $712 mln sale for Oct 23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Jersey Transportation Trust Fund $712.5 million transportation system revenue bond issue is slated for sale October 23 through competitive auction.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
